(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF ELECTRONICS AND INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY \(MEITY\)) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: MEITY SAMRIDH SCHEME FOR TECH STARTUPS \(SAMRIDH\) / MEITY STARTUP HUB \(MSH\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Scheme for Accelerators to pick and scale early-stage software and deeptech) Tj
T*
(product startups with matched government capital and investor cohorts.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. DPIIT Recognized Software Product Startups.) Tj
T*
(2. Must have an operating prototype or market-ready SaaS/hardware/AI) Tj
T*
(   product.) Tj
T*
(3. Must be admitted to an empaneled accelerator program.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Matched equity/debt investment of up to Rs. 40 Lakh per startup alongside) Tj
T*
(   accelerator cohort funding.) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 100.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 40.0 Lakh per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. DPIIT Certificate) Tj
T*
(2. Software IP / Product Demo Video) Tj
T*
(3. Accelerator Empanelment Letter) Tj
T*
(4. Customer Traction & Revenue Proof) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online via MeitY Startup Hub Portal) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://meity.gov.in/samridh-scheme) Tj
T*
ET
